        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sawli gwasawan Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobalool Sawli Yonatan was orjeedaanyi sea fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda, nea gwayeesha abwara Dawdi. Nea abeeda orjeeda Sawli was Yonatan ghabwariiy muuchi Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yonatan Dawdi, “Bwaabwa was Sawli gagasa ghabwarnyi; asi fura geaw sakteayda, una ak giibiidi heeda jea funya geaw ea meadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydawa ak ghaamiinaadi aba murdeeda bwaabwa aba jarooda heeda indi, ak gaydeabalool bwaabwa aba badaydaang'u; ama aadaayi gil gaydarukuneey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool Yonatan ghweandaanyi was Sawli muuchi aba badayda Dawdi, ak gwayeesha, “Gidabal ea mwanyasa sugoocheanda riing'eeda aba badayda siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Dawdi; aba gideaba mii gwasineey riing'eeda, ak gweagu gideaba gadiyoojigaaschi sinneey aamiyaas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ghoaghaashta eaweagaaschi ak ghabwar fuga Filisti, ak ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA jooriischooda buuneesean bea Israeli. Ak gidaahi, ak gihoosani; ak abeeda ghwasaan inyas gaysina riing'eeda aba badayda foojeanda manda giidiinyeanda ak gaybwara Dawdi nea mandeawana giidiinyeanda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiiy Sawli ng'asheega Yonatan; ak ghwaak Sawli habeawooda nea gwayi, “Aba gidabiideata Ng'utamiida, majeabwar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaguursa Yonatan Dawdi, ak gwarukusa ng'asheesu seaniin. Ng'ata gweadu Yonatan Dawdi heeda Sawli, ak gagadiyeesiinda gidaghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gabiikta ghang'eat ng'ucheeda; ak gawa Dawdi gang'uchi sea fuga Filisti, ak ghabwar fuga saang'a aba jeenyaawa, ea gamng'aw aba madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu guroorooda muy bea NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Sawli, damanda apteadawa aba gheanyi nea gwanda geatindaanyi ng'utaanyi; nea ghabwar Dawdi gidoondooriida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gagasa Sawli gang'usa Dawdi ghamarda aba ng'uta; ak gamulsa Sawli, ak ghang'ut ghamarda aba ng'uta. Ak ghafwach Dawdi ak ghafuy geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bugusteaba eaweedida goojeakta Sawli giijasoodiga gheeh Dawdi goong'weersa, eabwar sakteayda. Iidu gwayeesha Mikali was gatmooda Dawdi niny, “Iimiighuuhi eaweagaagu eaweani, numuji gajeabwarnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoararaang'daawa Mikali Dawdi seawadeeda; ak ghafwach ak ghafuy geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Mikali giduurji siida ak ghwayiin badayda bulaliida ak gwadiiwa uhuuda gheabuuscheanda sisna buudeega nooga, ak gookwealsa hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea goojeagu Sawli giijasoodiga ghoang'waay Dawdi, gwayeesha, “Ghamnyaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeakta Sawli giijasoodiga ghwadaah Dawdi nea gwayeesha, “Ayeani niny heedeanyu aba badayda bulaliida, ak gaydabwar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghapka giijasoodiga gah, ging'ulayi gwanda badayda bulaliida gidamawoosa siida, nea gwadiiwa uhuudaanyi gheabuuscheanda sisna buudeega nooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha Mikali, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i inyas gireenganiidinean, ea nung' gawa weajoocheandeanyu ak ghamneawa ea nifuy geaw?” Ghwalamda Mikali ak gwayeesha Sawli, “Gwayeeshiinean, ‘Sikseani dawa; ghwasaan inyas gaynung' dabwarnyi?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghafwach Dawdi ak ghafuy geaw, ak gawa heeda Samweli aba Rama, ak gwarukusa ng'asheega sean sima Sawli niny. Ak gawa niny sea Samweli ak goobiida Nayoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geerukusa Sawli, gideaba “Ng'ula, Dawdi gwanda Nayoti mida jeeda ng'eanyiida Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Sawli giijasoodiga ghoang'waay Dawdi; ak iidu nea ghwadaah mughuusheanda sibanga nea gwaramoorani ng'asheega, nea ghamiinaada Samweli aba madeanyaawa nea haweewa saawa, hean ghwahidu Guroorooda ASEETA heeda giijasoodiga Sawli, ak eara saawa ghwaramoar ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geerukusa Sawli, goojeakta giijasoodi suuk, ak eara saawa ghwaramoar ng'asheega. Ak gabiikta Sawli gicha goojeakta giijasoodiga deaba samwagu, ak eara saawa ghwaramoar ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat niny ak gawa heeda Rama, ak ghapka ea ghwahidu healadeeda haw mida Seku; ak ghoanyaashta, gideaba “Gwanda yeenu Samweli ea Dawdi?” Ghwalamda siyagi ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula, gwanda Nayoti aba ng'eanyiida Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghabeawa hoowa ak gawa Nayoti aba Rama; ak ghwahidu Guroorooda ASEETA headaanyi eara niny, nea damanda beawa gwaramoorani ng'asheega, ea ghwahita Nayoti aba Rama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara niny ghafwakta hang'weakaaschi, ak eara niny gwaramoori ng'asheega aba madeeda Samweli, ak gawiil geaw nea dawiish askweardida seaniin ea eaweeda seaniin. Nea gwayi, “Eara Sawli gaba jeeda sibanga?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
